---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="页面未找到 | 机场 Pro" 
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在。"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="not-found">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <h2>页面未找到</h2>
    <p>抱歉，您访问的页面可能已被移除、重命名或暂时不可用。</p>
    <p class="links"><a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a> <a href="/compare/" class="btn btn-secondary">机场对比表</a> <a href="/tutorials/" class="btn btn-secondary">使用教程</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 1rem;
  }
  .not-found h1 {
    font-size: 6rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .links { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .not-found h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
